  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>The vector <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> is rotated through a right angle, passing through the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-axis in its way and the resulting vector is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p>Now taking,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;{note here we have taken cross vector with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;as it is rotated along <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis}</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Also magnitude of both vector will be equal,</p><p>So,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>12</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>(Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math> rejected <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover></math> makes acute angle with y axis )</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now projection of&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p>",
